# Production-image TCB hygiene (B2.6-P1 Corrective VIII, Gate VIII-5).
#
# The production image must not ship test/debug mutation tooling: no test
# module may reach canonical mutable state in production. App code never
# imports backend.tests (repo-wide fence + reachability census), and no
# workflow executes pytest inside the image -- tests run from the source
# checkout. Excluding the test tree therefore narrows the packaged TCB
# without changing production behavior. The pytest/pytest-asyncio packages
# remain installed via backend/requirements.txt (shared with CI test jobs);
# with no test modules packaged and no app-code import path, they are
# inert. A future split of prod/test requirements may remove them.
backend/tests
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
.pytest_cache
.hypothesis
